      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re introducing Gemini 4 Hydrogen, bringing cutting-edge intelligence to everyone — with speed and efficiency for everyday coding and agentic workflows.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "While our frontier models, Gemini 4 Carbon and Gemini 4 Argon , excel at deep, long-horizon reasoning on your hardest problems, Hydrogen is built for rapid execution across diverse agentic workflows.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Hydrogen, we’re also bringing Gemini 4 to everyone — for all tiers of Google AI Studio , the Gemini API, Gemini for business , the Gemini app , Google Search , and paid Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in Google Antigravity .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Hydrogen is priced flat across its entire 1 million-token context window at $1.50 per million input tokens and $7.50 per million output tokens.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Beyond multi-model workflows, Hydrogen is a major standalone upgrade for teams migrating from Gemini 3.8 Flash.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Using a custom skill for video assembly and adhering to a creative brief, Gemini 4 Hydrogen created an archival sizzle reel about the element ‘Hydrogen’, sourcing public-domain footage and cutting it into one continuous edit with clean narration.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Hydrogen brings improvements from our latest Gemini 4 safety and security stack to our broadest audience yet, combining built-in training with real-time surface safeguards to help mitigate both misalignment and misuse.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-12T18:00:50.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-13T17:42:11.415Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Hydrogen, available to everyone today",
